  "name": "Ranged Attacks",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Dexterity by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains a ranged natural weapon attack with a range of 80/320. The damage die of this attack is identical to its other natural attacks and uses the same ability score for attack and damage rolls.</p><p>You can choose the damage type of the ranged attack from one of the following: acid, bludgeoning, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, piercing, poison, radiant, slashing, or thunder.</p>",
